&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Early Careers Team are looking for a Senior Early Careers Assistant for a 14 month FTC to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Key dates: From November 2026 - January 2028 (14 month FTC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot;&gt;The Early Careers team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;shaping the end-to-end Early Careers journey at Baringa, from attracting and recruiting talented individuals to onboarding and supporting their development. Working in partnership with the business, we deliver impactful and inclusive experiences that enable junior talent to thrive and build successful careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW79626611 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will support the end-to-end delivery of our Early Careers programmes, helping to attract, recruit, onboard, and develop talented Interns and Analysts across Baringa’s global offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partnership Management &amp;amp; Attraction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;26&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;strong relationships with Baringa&#39;s Early Careers attraction partners,&amp;nbsp;ensuring maximum engagement and return on investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
